<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Timeless Elegance Jewelry</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@100;200;300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-luxury: #fbf9e2;
            --accent-rich: #965123;
            --metallic-gold: #bf8039;
            --deep-elegance: #462415;
            --spacing-xl: 6rem;
            --spacing-lg: 4rem;
            --spacing-md: 2rem;
            --spacing-sm: 1rem;
            --border-radius: 8px;
            --transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-luxury);
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding-top: 100px;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        /* Page Header */
        .page-header.editable-section[data-section="149"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-md);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"]::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 140px;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--metallic-gold), var(--accent-rich));
        }

        .about-subtitle.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="151"] {
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero-about.editable-section[data-section="152"] {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-image {
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(70, 36, 21, 0.1);
            height: 500px;
            width: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .hero-content.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="153"] {
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .hero-content h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="154"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .hero-content p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="155"] {
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .highlight-text.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="156"] {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--accent-rich);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--metallic-gold);
            padding-left: var(--spacing-sm);
            margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
        }

        /* Mission & Values */
        .mission-values.editable-section[data-section="157"] {
            background: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-lg);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(70, 36, 21, 0.05);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .mission-values h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="158"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
        }

        .values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .value-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="159"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .value-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--metallic-gold);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .value-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="160"] {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .value-description.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="161"] {
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .mission-statement.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="162"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-lg);
            background: rgba(191, 128, 57, 0.05);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .mission-statement h3.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="163"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .mission-statement p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="164"] {
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Craftsmanship Section */
        .craftsmanship.editable-section[data-section="165"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .craftsmanship h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="166"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
        }

        .craftsmanship-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            align-items: center;
        }

        .craftsmanship-image {
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(70, 36, 21, 0.1);
            height: 400px;
            width: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .craftsmanship-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="167"] {
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .craftsmanship-text h3.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="168"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .craftsmanship-text p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="169"] {
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .craftsmanship-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-sm);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .stat-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="170"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-sm);
            background: rgba(191, 128, 57, 0.05);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
        }

        .stat-number.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="171"] {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--accent-rich);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .stat-label.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="172"] {
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Our Story Timeline */
        .story-timeline.editable-section[data-section="173"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .story-timeline h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="174"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
        }

        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--metallic-gold);
        }

        .timeline-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="175"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            position: relative;
            width: 45%;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) {
            margin-left: 0;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: 0;
        }

        .timeline-content {
            background: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(70, 36, 21, 0.05);
            position: relative;
        }

        .timeline-year.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="176"] {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--accent-rich);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="177"] {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .timeline-description.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="178"] {
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            background: var(--accent-rich);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 20px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before {
            right: -38px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
            left: -38px;
        }

        /* Team Section */
        .team-section.editable-section[data-section="179"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .team-section h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="180"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
        }

        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .team-member.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="181"] {
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(70, 36, 21, 0.05);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .team-member.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="181"]:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(70, 36, 21, 0.1);
        }

        .team-member-image {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-sm);
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 3px solid var(--bg-luxury);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(70, 36, 21, 0.1);
            display: block;
        }

        .team-member-name.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="182"] {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .team-member-role.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="183"] {
            color: var(--metallic-gold);
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .team-member-bio.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="184"] {
            color: var(--deep-elegance);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Commitment Section */
        .commitment.editable-section[data-section="185"] {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--deep-elegance), var(--accent-rich));
            color: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-xl);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .commitment h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="186"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
            color: white;
        }

        .commitment p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="187"] {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-lg);
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .commitment-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-md);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .commitment-stat.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="188"] {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .commitment-number.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="189"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--metallic-gold);
        }

        .commitment-label.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="190"] {
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Responsive Styles */
        @media (max-width: 1200px) {
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
            
            .values-grid,
            .craftsmanship-stats,
            .commitment-stats {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
                font-size: 3.2rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .hero-about.editable-section[data-section="152"],
            .craftsmanship-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .hero-image,
            .craftsmanship-image {
                height: 400px;
                order: -1;
            }
            
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
            }
            
            .timeline::before {
                left: 30px;
            }
            
            .timeline-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="175"] {
                width: calc(100% - 60px);
                margin-left: 60px !important;
                margin-right: 0 !important;
            }
            
            .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before,
            .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
                left: -38px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            main{
                padding-top: 80px;
            }
            
            .hero-about.editable-section[data-section="152"] {
                gap: var(--spacing-md);
                margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            }
            
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            
            .about-subtitle.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="151"] {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            
            .container {
                padding: 0 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .mission-values.editable-section[data-section="157"],
            .commitment.editable-section[data-section="185"] {
                padding: var(--spacing-md);
            }
            
            .hero-content h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="154"],
            .mission-values h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="158"],
            .craftsmanship h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="166"],
            .story-timeline h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="174"],
            .team-section h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="180"],
            .commitment h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="186"] {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 400px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }
            
            .values-grid,
            .craftsmanship-stats,
            .commitment-stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            
            .about-subtitle.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="151"] {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            
            .hero-image,
            .craftsmanship-image {
                height: 300px;
            }
            
            .value-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="159"],
            .team-member.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="181"] {
                padding: var(--spacing-sm);
            }
            
            .team-member-image {
                width: 120px;
                height: 120px;
            }
            
            .commitment.editable-section[data-section="185"] {
                padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-sm);
            }
            
            .commitment h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="186"] {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .commitment p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="187"] {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <!-- Page Header -->
<div class="page-header editable-section" data-section="314">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="about-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="315" data-text="215">Our Story</h1>
        <p class="about-subtitle editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="316" data-text="216">For nearly a century, we have crafted jewelry that tells stories, celebrates milestones, and becomes treasured heirlooms.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<div class="container">
    <div class="hero-about editable-section" data-section="317">
        <img class="hero-image editable-image" data-image="46" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605100940501-e61926f5e72d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1470&q=80" alt="Jewelry craftsmanship">
        <div class="hero-content editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="318">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="319" data-text="217">Timeless Craftsmanship Since 1925</h2>
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="320" data-text="218">Founded by master jeweler Giovanni Moretti in Florence, Italy, Timeless Elegance began as a small atelier dedicated to the art of fine jewelry making. Giovanni's vision was simple yet profound: to create pieces that would transcend generations, becoming family heirlooms that tell stories of love, celebration, and legacy.</p>
            
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="321" data-text="219">Today, guided by Giovanni's great-granddaughter Sofia Moretti, we continue this tradition of excellence from our New York atelier, blending century-old techniques with contemporary design.</p>
            
            <p class="highlight-text editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="322" data-text="220">"Jewelry is not just adornment; it is a story waiting to be told, a memory waiting to be cherished." - Sofia Moretti</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mission & Values -->
    <div class="mission-values editable-section" data-section="323">
        <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="324" data-text="221">Our Philosophy</h2>
        
        <div class="values-grid">
            <!-- Value 1 - Editable Template -->
            <div class="value-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="325">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-gem editable-icon" data-icon="47" data-default-class="fas fa-gem"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="326" data-text="222">Uncompromising Quality</h3>
                <p class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="327" data-text="223">We source only the finest ethically-mined gemstones and precious metals, with each piece undergoing 47 quality checks before it leaves our atelier.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Value 2 - Non-editable (follows template) -->
            <div class="value-item">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-hands"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="value-title">Artisan Craftsmanship</h3>
                <p class="value-description">Every piece is handcrafted by master jewelers using techniques passed down through generations, ensuring unparalleled attention to detail.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Value 3 - Non-editable (follows template) -->
            <div class="value-item">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="value-title">Personal Connection</h3>
                <p class="value-description">We believe jewelry should tell your unique story. Our designers work closely with clients to create pieces that reflect personal style and significance.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mission-statement editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="328">
            <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="329" data-text="224">Our Mission</h3>
            <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="330" data-text="225">To create heirloom-quality jewelry that celebrates life's most meaningful moments, combining timeless design with exceptional craftsmanship while maintaining ethical and sustainable practices throughout our supply chain.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Craftsmanship Section -->
    <div class="craftsmanship editable-section" data-section="331">
        <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="332" data-text="226">The Art of Craftsmanship</h2>
        
        <div class="craftsmanship-content">
            <div class="craftsmanship-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="333">
                <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="334" data-text="227">Masterful Precision</h3>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="335" data-text="228">Each Timeless Elegance piece begins with a vision, translated into precise hand-drawn sketches by our design team. From these drawings, our master jewelers select the finest materials and begin the meticulous process of creation.</p>
                
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="336" data-text="229">Our signature setting technique, developed by Giovanni Moretti in 1932, allows diamonds and gemstones to capture maximum light while ensuring exceptional security. This proprietary method takes three times longer than standard settings but results in unparalleled brilliance.</p>
                
                <div class="craftsmanship-stats">
                    <!-- Stat 1 - Editable Template -->
                    <div class="stat-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="337">
                        <div class="stat-number editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="338" data-text="230">47</div>
                        <div class="stat-label editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="339" data-text="231">Quality Checks</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Stat 2 - Non-editable -->
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">120</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Hours Minimum</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Stat 3 - Non-editable -->
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <div class="stat-number">98<span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">%</span></div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Recycled Gold</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <img class="craftsmanship-image editable-image" data-image="48" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605100940281-ba7a5b9a5c8c?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1470&q=80" alt="Jewelry craftsmanship process">
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Our Story Timeline -->
    <div class="story-timeline editable-section" data-section="340">
        <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="341" data-text="232">Our Journey Through Time</h2>
        
        <div class="timeline">
            <!-- Timeline Item 1 - Editable Template -->
            <div class="timeline-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="342">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="343" data-text="233">1925</div>
                    <h3 class="timeline-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="344" data-text="234">Humble Beginnings</h3>
                    <p class="timeline-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="345" data-text="235">Giovanni Moretti opens a small atelier in Florence, Italy, specializing in bespoke engagement rings and family crest jewelry for European nobility.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Timeline Item 2 - Non-editable -->
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year">1955</div>
                    <h3 class="timeline-title">Expansion to New York</h3>
                    <p class="timeline-description">Giovanni's son, Marco Moretti, establishes the first American boutique on Fifth Avenue, introducing Italian craftsmanship to the New York elite.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Timeline Item 3 - Non-editable -->
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year">1988</div>
                    <h3 class="timeline-title">Sustainable Practices</h3>
                    <p class="timeline-description">Under Elena Moretti's leadership, we pioneer ethical sourcing initiatives, becoming one of the first jewelry houses to use 100% conflict-free diamonds.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Timeline Item 4 - Non-editable -->
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year">2020</div>
                    <h3 class="timeline-title">Digital Innovation</h3>
                    <p class="timeline-description">Launch of our virtual design studio, allowing clients worldwide to collaborate with our designers in real-time, while maintaining our artisanal approach.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Timeline Item 5 - Non-editable -->
            <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-content">
                    <div class="timeline-year">Present Day</div>
                    <h3 class="timeline-title">Global Recognition</h3>
                    <p class="timeline-description">With boutiques in New York, London, and Tokyo, and online presence serving 50+ countries, we continue to honor our heritage while innovating for the future.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Team Section -->
    <div class="team-section editable-section" data-section="346">
        <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="347" data-text="236">Meet Our Master Artisans</h2>
        
        <div class="team-grid">
            <!-- Team Member 1 - Editable Template -->
            <div class="team-member editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="348">
                <img class="team-member-image editable-image" data-image="49" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=687&q=80" alt="Sofia Moretti">
                <h3 class="team-member-name editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="349" data-text="237">Sofia Moretti</h3>
                <div class="team-member-role editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="350" data-text="238">Creative Director</div>
                <p class="team-member-bio editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="351" data-text="239">Great-granddaughter of founder Giovanni Moretti, Sofia brings contemporary vision while honoring family traditions. Graduate of Central Saint Martins with 15 years of design experience.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Team Member 2 - Non-editable -->
            <div class="team-member">
                <img class="team-member-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=688&q=80" alt="James Chen">
                <h3 class="team-member-name">James Chen</h3>
                <div class="team-member-role">Master Goldsmith</div>
                <p class="team-member-bio">With 25 years of experience, James specializes in intricate metalwork and our signature setting technique. Trained in both traditional Chinese and European jewelry making.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Team Member 3 - Non-editable -->
            <div class="team-member">
                <img class="team-member-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582750433449-648ed127bb54?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=687&q=80" alt="Isabelle Laurent">
                <h3 class="team-member-name">Isabelle Laurent</h3>
                <div class="team-member-role">Gemologist</div>
                <p class="team-member-bio">GIA-certified gemologist with expertise in rare colored diamonds and gemstone sourcing. Isabelle ensures every stone meets our rigorous ethical and quality standards.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Team Member 4 - Non-editable -->
            <div class="team-member">
                <img class="team-member-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=687&q=80" alt="Marcus Rodriguez">
                <h3 class="team-member-name">Marcus Rodriguez</h3>
                <div class="team-member-role">Design Director</div>
                <p class="team-member-bio">Former architect turned jewelry designer, Marcus brings structural innovation to our collections. His designs have won multiple international jewelry awards.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Commitment Section -->
    <div class="commitment editable-section" data-section="352">
        <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="353" data-text="240">Our Commitment to Excellence</h2>
        <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="354" data-text="241">For nearly a century, our commitment has remained unwavering: to create jewelry that not only dazzles today but becomes tomorrow's heirlooms. Every piece we create carries this legacy forward.</p>
        
        <div class="commitment-stats">
            <!-- Stat 1 - Editable Template -->
            <div class="commitment-stat editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="355">
